# Use only development/test environments. Cookie/token placeholders are private.
@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@workerSession = REPLACE_WITH_EXISTING_WORKER_COOKIE
@customerSession = REPLACE_WITH_EXISTING_HIRING_CUSTOMER_COOKIE
@claim = REPLACE_WITH_CLAIM_UUID
@request = REPLACE_WITH_REQUEST_UUID
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ONCE_RETURNED_CONFIRMATION_TOKEN
@guest = REPLACE_WITH_COOKIE_FROM_CHALLENGE_CHECK
@draft = REPLACE_WITH_DRAFT_UUID
@message = REPLACE_WITH_MESSAGE_UUID

### 201: explicit unscored informal declaration
POST {{base}}/me/history-claims
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}
Idempotency-Key: 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"details":{"work_type":"Plumbing","description":"Repaired a leaking pipe. Agreed fee ₦5000.","date_text":"around September 2026","general_area":"Ikeja","claimed_completed":true,"language":"en"}}

### Retry unchanged POST above returns same claim. Changed body/key reuse -> 409.
### Read receipt first after an interrupted submission; absent operation -> 404 OPERATION_NOT_FOUND.
GET {{base}}/me/history-claims/operations/10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Paginated declaration history
GET {{base}}/me/history-claims?page=1&size=20
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### 201: link once; subsequent replay returns token:null
POST {{base}}/me/history-claims/{{claim}}/confirmation-requests
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}
Idempotency-Key: 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":1,"recipient_phone":"+2348012345678"}

### Reconcile lost secret; revoke before replacing this completed request
GET {{base}}/me/history-claims/{{claim}}/confirmation-requests/operations/10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Bearer alone -> access:contact_required, details:null, masked phone only
GET {{base}}/history-confirmations/{{token}}

### Development: sandbox:true + debug_code; production uses SMS and returns no debug code
POST {{base}}/history-confirmations/{{token}}/challenge

### Incorrect code -> 400 CODE_INVALID (attempt commits); five checks exhaust challenge.
# Replace this value with the actual SMS code or visible development stub code.
POST {{base}}/history-confirmations/{{token}}/challenge/check
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"123456"}

### Successful challenge sets history_recipient; cookie alone cannot access another request
GET {{base}}/history-confirmations/{{token}}
Cookie: history_recipient={{guest}}

### Explicit consent/customer declaration; duplicate new operation -> 409 RESPONSE_EXISTS
POST {{base}}/history-confirmations/{{token}}/response
Cookie: history_recipient={{guest}}
Idempotency-Key: 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"confirmed","declares_customer":true,"consent":true}

### Receipt recovery before retrying; current response is returned on authorized GET
GET {{base}}/history-confirmations/{{token}}
Cookie: history_recipient={{guest}}

### Same original remains authoritative; message alone confirms nothing
POST {{base}}/history-confirmations/{{token}}/messages
Cookie: history_recipient={{guest}}
Idempotency-Key: 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"I did not agree to ₦5000. Was the date 2026-09-15?","language":"en"}

### 200 receipt / 404 OPERATION_NOT_FOUND, never another participant's operation
GET {{base}}/history-confirmations/{{token}}/messages/operations/10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004
Cookie: history_recipient={{guest}}

### Model/revision derivative; failed translation keeps original. Provider unconfigured -> failed metadata.
POST {{base}}/history-confirmations/{{token}}/messages/{{message}}/translations
Cookie: history_recipient={{guest}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"target":"yo"}

### Private worker thread; page cap 100
GET {{base}}/me/history-claims/{{claim}}/messages?page=1&size=20
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Withdraw removes active attestation, retains audit
DELETE {{base}}/history-confirmations/{{token}}/response
Cookie: history_recipient={{guest}}

### New immutable revision; revokes previous tokens and invalidates previous confirmations
PATCH {{base}}/me/history-claims/{{claim}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":1,"details":{"work_type":"Plumbing","description":"Corrected: fee ₦4000, not ₦5000","date_text":"around September 2026","general_area":"Ikeja","claimed_completed":true,"language":"en"}}

### Old token after correction -> 410 LINK_UNAVAILABLE, even with earlier guest cookie
GET {{base}}/history-confirmations/{{token}}
Cookie: history_recipient={{guest}}

### Explicit revocation is idempotent; metadata list contains no recoverable token/phone
DELETE {{base}}/me/confirmation-requests/{{request}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Native job: creation uses job_id, request omits phone; existing customer session must match Job.client_id
GET {{base}}/history-confirmations/{{token}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{customerSession}}

### Wrong account cannot see private native job or submit a response (403 for response/message).
### Forwarded informal link cannot submit until intended contact is verified.
### Expired/revoked link -> 410; bad/unknown token -> 404; cross-origin mutation -> 403.
### Rate limit -> 429 + Retry-After; Redis/provider outage -> 503 + preserved inputs.
### Missing Idempotency-Key, invalid UUID/language/phone, consent:false -> 422.

### Optional voice capabilities (do not treat configured as evaluated quality)
GET {{base}}/me/history-capabilities
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Multipart upload example: edit local audio path; actual duration is validated asynchronously.
# POST /me/history-drafts, Idempotency-Key UUID, fields audio(file), language=yo, consent=true.
# curl --cookie "guarantor_session=$WORKER_COOKIE" \
#   -H 'Idempotency-Key: 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005' \
#   -F 'language=yo' -F 'consent=true' -F 'audio=@/private/tmp/approved-recording.webm' \
#   http://localhost:8000/api/v1/me/history-drafts

### Recover upload ID before retrying; does not require provider currently online
GET {{base}}/me/history-drafts/operations/10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Poll queued/processing/ready/failed/expired; paths and audio never returned
GET {{base}}/me/history-drafts/{{draft}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Retry same failed task, bounded attempts, original retained only until expiry
POST {{base}}/me/history-drafts/{{draft}}/retry
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Approve corrected draft explicitly; repeat exact approval cannot duplicate claims
POST {{base}}/me/history-drafts/{{draft}}/save
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved":true,"details":{"work_type":"Plumbing","description":"Worker-reviewed description","date_text":"last month","general_area":"Ikeja","claimed_completed":true,"language":"yo"}}

### Existing canonical record includes separate informal_history counts, unaffected assessment
GET {{base}}/me/record
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Public sharing still uses existing standard-summary flows in feature_examples.http.
### Claims/conversations/transcripts/phone numbers never appear in verified credential exports.

### Speech capabilities (existing worker session cookie)
GET {{base}}/me/history-speech-capabilities

### Queue exact translated text as speech; response 202, no provider configured -> 503 SPEECH_UNAVAILABLE
POST {{base}}/me/history-claims/{{claim_id}}/messages/{{message_id}}/audio
Content-Type: application/json

{"target":"yo"}

### Reconcile queued/processing/ready/failed/expired without resending the original message
GET {{base}}/me/history-claims/{{claim_id}}/messages/{{message_id}}/audio/{{audio_id}}

### Private MP3: missing/revoked access fails; no-store on successful response
GET {{base}}/me/history-claims/{{claim_id}}/messages/{{message_id}}/audio/{{audio_id}}/content
